  "citation": "Kittel T G F; Rosenbloom N A; Painter T H; Schimel D S; Fisher H H; Grimsdell A; Daly C (1995): VEMAP - Phase I Database: An Integrated INPUT Dataset for ECOSYSTEM and Vegetation Modeling for the Conterminous United States. CDIAC. Dataset. doi:10.15485/1464222",
  "dataset": {
